            "block_content": "SECTION 7.12.2. Employees utilizing personal vehicles and who qualify for per diem will be paid a mileage allowance consistent with Company policy, but no less than $0.31 per mile, for all miles associated with the assignment in excess of the distance between the regular reporting center and the temporary reporting center.",
